  <!-- EN: cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.label>凈世爆彈槍</Gun_CleansingBolter.label>
  <!-- EN: One of the most effective anti-neconoid firearm developed by the brilliant minds of the glitterworld mechanists. This bolter fires bolter rounds which is filled with ANB "Anti Necronoid Biomass" nanites, where once inside a necronoid, it'll run rampant and destroy necronoid cells, dealing heavy amounts of damage to a necronoid entity while deals normal damage to normal living beings.\n\nSuch a weapon was developed after experiencing countless deaths and losses, where humanity finally reached a breakthrough in pushing back the necronoid army. -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.description>由閃耀世界最頂尖的技師研製的先進武器，也是最適合反製歿疫感染體的武器。凈世爆彈槍所使用的彈藥內裝有反歿疫病毒（簡稱“ANB”）奈米機械，擊中歿疫感染體後會迅速破壞它們的細胞組織，以此造成極高的額外傷害。\n\n雖然這種武器的研製伴隨著無數的流血與犧牲，但也幫助人類在擊退歿疫屍軍方面取得了重大進展。</Gun_CleansingBolter.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>凈世爆彈槍</Gun_CleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: cleansing rocket launcher -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.label>凈世火箭發射器</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A single use rocket launcher used to destroy fortified necronoid structures and boss-like necronoid entities. The rocket launcher fires a concentrated ANB nanite rockets in a single exchange, and can decimate anything under a 2.9 blast radius. The rocket launcher has a maximum number of 100 shots before it becomes un-usable. -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.description>用於高效摧毀歿疫建築和對抗高階歿疫感染體的武器。凈世火箭發射器所使用的火箭彈內裝有反歿疫病毒（簡稱“ANB”）奈米機械，擊中歿疫感染體後會迅速破壞它們的細胞組織，以此造成極高的額外傷害。\n\n\n\n這種武器僅裝有100枚火箭彈，消耗完畢後將無法使用。</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.chargeNoun>火箭彈</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.cooldownGerund>冷卻中</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: cleansing rocket launcher -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.verbs.VerbShootReloadable.label>凈世火箭發射器</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.verbs.VerbShootReloadable.label>
  
  <!-- EN: cleansing shotgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.label>凈世霰彈槍</Gun_CleansingShotgun.label>
  <!-- EN: A KS 23 shotgun carbine that fires cleansing shotgun shells. Due to its rifled barrel, the cleansing shotgun can fire cleansing pellets at an incredible range, which is a stark contrast towards other shotguns out there. Though it possess a slow fire rate, each shot packs a lot of fire power coupled with a strong stopping power which is capable of nailing down fast moving opponents in its place. This shotgun also deals a monstrous damage againsts any necronoid entity, giving it a fitting title as "The Doom Giver". -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.description>以KS-23泵動霰彈槍為藍本研製而成的武器，其使用的彈藥內裝有反歿疫病毒（簡稱“ANB”）奈米機械，擊中歿疫感染體後會迅速破壞它們的細胞組織，以此造成極高的額外傷害。凈世霰彈槍配備有特殊改裝過的槍管，射程要比尋常的霰彈槍遠得多。雖然射速不快，但在它強勁的傷害與抑製能力面前，任何歿疫感染體都無法前進半步，有些人便據此將其稱作“毀滅使者”。</Gun_CleansingShotgun.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: cleansing shotgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>凈世霰彈槍</Gun_CleansingShotgun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
