  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing autocannon -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.label>帝國凈世重砲</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.label>
  <!-- EN: One of the most effective heavy weapon againsts any necronoid entity. The autocannon uses a special 20mm AP cleansing bullet, capable of breaching even the hardest of necronoid flesh and deals massive amounts of damage upon impact. This weapon is seen being used by the imperial necro hunters. -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.description>通常由破碎帝國的歿疫獵人們使用的重型武器，其使用的20mm穿甲彈藥內裝有反歿疫病毒（簡稱“ANB”）奈米機械，擊中歿疫感染體後會迅速破壞它們的細胞組織，以此造成極高的額外傷害。即使拋開這些不談，帝國凈世重砲本身的傷害與穿甲能力也足夠出色，任何歿疫感染體都無法擋下它的一擊。</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing autocannon -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>帝國凈世重砲</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.label>帝國凈世爆彈槍</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.label>
  <!-- EN: A special cleansing bolter designed for imperial use. Unlike the original, this weapon receives better modifications, giving it extented bolter magazine and reinforced gun barrel. -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.description>專為破碎帝國的士兵們設計的先進武器，其使用的彈藥內裝有反歿疫病毒（簡稱“ANB”）奈米機械，擊中歿疫感染體後會迅速破壞它們的細胞組織，以此造成極高的額外傷害。與普通的凈世爆彈槍有所不同，帝國凈世爆彈槍經過了諸多改裝，配備有更出色的加長彈匣和加固槍管。</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>帝國凈世爆彈槍</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing bolter machinegun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.label>帝國凈世爆彈機槍</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.label>
  <!-- EN: A special cleansing bolter machinegun designed for imperial use. Although slightly in-accurate, it can fire a barrage of cleansing bullets at long distances, perfect for providing suppressive fire. -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.description>專為破碎帝國的士兵們設計的先進武器，其使用的彈藥內裝有反歿疫病毒（簡稱“ANB”）奈米機械，擊中歿疫感染體後會迅速破壞它們的細胞組織，以此造成極高的額外傷害。雖然精度不高，但帝國凈世爆彈機槍能遠距離提供極強的壓製火力。</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing bolter machinegun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>帝國凈世爆彈機槍</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Lahti L-39 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.label>L-39反坦克步槍（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.label>
  <!-- EN: An incendiary version of the Lahti L-39 anti- material, which uses AP incendiary rounds. This gun hits the hardest among the other incendiary weapons, thanks to its frame made of plasteel, the gun wont be destroyed due to the immense recoil. -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.description>於古地球第二次世界大戰期間研製並生產的反坦克步槍。這種武器因具有出色的精度、射程和穿甲能力而榮獲“獵象槍”的綽號，但亦有不便攜帶、後坐力過大等缺點。\n\n這種武器發射特製的穿甲燃燒彈，經過塑鋼加固的槍身顯著降低了它開火時產生的後坐力。</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.stock.label>槍托</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Lahti L-39 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>L-39反坦克步槍（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Sturmgewehr 44 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.label>StG44突擊步槍（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.label>
  <!-- EN: An incendiary version of the standard sturmgewehr 44, which uses AP incendiary rounds. This gun is somewhat light-weight and very compact which offers ease of use during deployment, and just like the MG-42, its barrel is reinforced in plasteel for continous automatic fire in medium range. -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.description>於古地球第二次世界大戰末期研製並生產的突擊步槍，也是人類史上首種大規模裝備的、真正意義上的突擊步槍。\n\n這種武器發射特製的穿甲燃燒彈，經過塑鋼加固的槍管使它可以更頻繁地連續開火。</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.stock.label>槍托</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.barrel.label>槍管</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Sturmgewehr 44 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>StG44突擊步槍（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: MG-42 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.label>MG42通用機槍（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: An incendiary version of the standard mg-42, which uses AP incendiary rounds. Using plasteel as a material for the gun barrel, the gun is immune to over-heating which allows for continuous firing, although it requires an amount of finesse to accurately use this gun. -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.description>於古地球第二次世界大戰末期被德軍廣泛使用的氣冷式通用機槍。這種射速極高的武器開火時有著“滋滋滋滋”的獨特槍聲，因此榮獲“希特勒的電鋸”、“撕布機”等綽號。\n\n這種武器發射特製的穿甲燃燒彈，經過塑鋼加固的槍管使它可以更頻繁地連續開火。</Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.description>
